#!/bin/bash
# B0: train the SAE with the unchanged upstream objective (MSE + dead-latent aux, k=32, x32, lr 5e-5,
# batch 4096). Upstream ships no trained checkpoint, so this is the baseline every P2 row starts from.
# qsub -P personal-riddhima scripts/nscc/baseline.pbs   (defaults: K=32, STEPS=228000 = 100 epochs over
# 8.84M passages + 0.50M train queries at batch 4096, as the paper; DECODER_NORM=row|atom)
#PBS -N p2_B0
#PBS -q normal
#PBS -l select=1:ncpus=16:ngpus=1:mem=110gb
#PBS -l walltime=24:00:00
#PBS -j oe
source "$PBS_O_WORKDIR/scripts/nscc/env.sh"
set -euo pipefail
python -m p2.train --data-dir "$DATA" --val-qrels "$RAW/split/validation.qrels" \
    --output "$CKPT/${NAME:-B0_upstream_objective}" --rank-loss none --steps "${STEPS:-228000}" --k "${K:-32}" \
    --eval-every 20000 --in-ram --decoder-norm "${DECODER_NORM:-row}" --device cuda
